<Layout title="Hire to Retire Process Mining and Analysis | RE-ViVE" description="Why does time to productivity vary so widely for the same role? RE-ViVE shows how hiring, onboarding and offboarding actually executed across HR and IT." current="/process-hire-to-retire">
